{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_33887","headline":"临顿爲吴中偏胜之地陆鲁望居之不出郛郭旷若郊墅余每相访欵然惜去因成五言十首奉题屋壁 五 · 皮日休","name":"临顿爲吴中偏胜之地陆鲁望居之不出郛郭旷若郊墅余每相访欵然惜去因成五言十首奉题屋壁 五","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"夏过无担石，日高开板扉。\n僧虽与筒簟，人不典蕉衣。\n鹤静共眠觉，鹭驯同钓归。\n生公石上月，何夕约谭微。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"皮日休","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_33887.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_33887","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}